1
00:00:00,024 --> 00:00:01,514
(Sheldon:)So stop using him against me.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:04,820
(Howard:)Okay, here we go.

3
00:00:05,062 --> 00:00:09,722
(Howard:)You find yourselves in an overgrown,
old forest.

4
00:00:09,967 --> 00:00:13,927
(Howard:)Before you is a giant oak tree
with a face on it...

5
00:00:14,104 --> 00:00:16,974
(Howard:)...that looks a lot like Nicolas Cage.

6
00:00:18,576 --> 00:00:19,596
He says:

7
00:00:19,777 --> 00:00:22,507
"Travel with caution...

8
00:00:24,515 --> 00:00:26,745
(Howard:)These woods are home...

9
00:00:26,984 --> 00:00:31,714
(Howard:)...to the bones
of many a fallen hero."

10
00:00:34,692 --> 00:00:38,392
Now, see? Howard's just as good
a Dungeon Master as I am.

11
00:00:38,762 --> 00:00:42,292
(Sheldon:)As good? You just got pantsed
in the schoolyard, four-eyes.

12
00:00:43,734 --> 00:00:45,034
(Raj:)Hey, come on, guys, focus.

13
00:00:45,202 --> 00:00:48,762
(Raj:)Um, uh, oh, mighty Nicolas Cage tree.

14
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:52,940
(Raj:)We thank you for your warning,
but we are brave warriors...

15
00:00:53,143 --> 00:00:59,023
(Raj:)...and nothing short of death
will keep us from our goal.

